[SPEAKER_01]: you want to fall, I guess this is a good thing to do. But once you start flying a little bit higher, this is definitely not safe. So basically

18:13.622 --> 18:22.813
[SPEAKER_00]: you got a really fun hoverboard. Like, I mean, you were at the height, which was almost skimming the ground and you were going super fast. yeah

18:22.933 --> 18:30.916
[SPEAKER_00]: exactly yeah yeah but i didn't use any board i was just you know i was giving an example like like i was basically skimming the height hole but

18:31.016 --> 18:38.318
