19:03.228 --> 19:12.800
[SPEAKER_01]: is, I think soaring and speed flying, this is the future. Yeah, and then, you know, Benny Belli, he came over one day with his old prototypes and we

19:12.840 --> 19:22.062
[SPEAKER_01]: flew them here and started that project again. And Benny basically then, you know, two years later, finished the project more or less on his

19:22.103 --> 19:32.046
